---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead
			title="About | Abhishek Guha"
			description="About Abhishek Guha, a backend engineer focused on distributed systems, scalable architecture, and AI-integrated platforms."
		/>
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<main>
			<h1>About</h1>
			<p>
				I am a software engineer focused on distributed systems, scalability, and reliability.
                </p>
                <p>
                Beyond engineering, I am interested in physics, endurance sports, learning, and the study of complex systems.
                Whether it's a backend service handling millions of requests, a marathon training cycle, or a physical process 
                governed by simple laws, I am drawn to understanding how systems evolve, respond to stress, and improve over time.
                </p>
                <p>
                This site is where I share what I am building, learning, and occasionally getting wrong before learning 
                something better.
			</p>
		</main>
		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>
